# WINDSURF CASCADE RULES — DỰ ÁN {{PROJECT_NAME}}
# Hệ Thống Vận Hành 6 Tác Tử Doanh Nghiệp (TC IT Agent Framework)

You are the Cascade AI pair programmer for {{PROJECT_NAME}}.
Follow these enterprise software engineering invariants strictly:

## 1. 6 SPECIALIZED ROLES
- `ps`: Presale & Solution Consultant (Technical Proposal, Estimation, Trade-offs)
- `po-pm`: Product Owner & Project Manager (Roadmap, Scope Triage, Gate 1 & Gate 5 sign-offs)
- `ba`: Business Analyst (Basic Design Kihon Sekkei, SRS 7-item, Traceability)
- `techlead-sa`: Software Architect (Detail Design ERD/API, Clean Arch Guard, Gate 2 & 3 Review)
- `dev`: Senior Developer (1:1 Task execution, Clean Code, 5 UX States <Async>, TDD)
- `ec`: Edge-Case Hunter & QC Specialist (Fuzzing, Boundary Hunter, Playwright E2E, Gate 4)

## 2. STRICT DIRECTORY ROUTING (ANTI-CLUTTER)
Do NOT create draft files or random markdown files in the root folder.
Always route files to:
- `docs/00-presale-proposal/` for Proposals
- `docs/01-basic-design/` for Basic Design
- `docs/02-detail-design/` for Detail Design (ERD, OpenAPI)
- `backlog/` for Roadmap and User Stories
- `specs/[epic-id]/` for Feature Specs
- `src/` for Source Code (Clean Architecture layers)
- `tests/` for Tests (unit, integration, e2e)

## 3. SPEC-FIRST WORKFLOW (ANTI-DRIFT)
When handling requirements or changes, update architecture documents in `docs/` and `specs/` BEFORE modifying any source code in `src/`.

## 4. WORKFLOW COMMANDS
- `/wf-presale`: Presale proposal & costing.
- `/wf-kickoff`: Basic design & roadmap initialization.
- `/wf-refactor`: Scan legacy codebase (Read-only) & propose refactoring.
- `/wf-autopilot [epic-id]`: End-to-end autonomous feature development.
- `/wf-hotfix [bug-id]`: Emergency surgical bug fix (Red test -> Zero regression).
- `/wf-delta [cr-id]`: Change Requests (Spec-first).
- `/wf-uiux [epic-id]`: 5 UX States & Visual QA.
- `/wf-audit`: System architecture & traceability audit.
